FACTS=["Ethiopia has 13 months: 12 of 30 days and Pagume of 5-6 days.","Ethiopia's calendar is about 7-8 years behind the Gregorian calendar.","Ethiopia is the birthplace of coffee (Coffea arabica).","Ethiopia was never colonised; it defeated Italy at Adwa in 1896.","Ethiopia has more UNESCO sites than most African countries, including Lalibela and Aksum.","Ethiopia uses its own script, Ge'ez (Fidel), with over 200 characters.","Ethiopia is among the world's oldest nations, with a history of over 3,000 years.","Lucy (Dinkinesh), a 3.2-million-year-old fossil, was found in Afar."]
